size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="ManyMeats" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2104082)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manymeats" >ManyMeats</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barheru" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6691112&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Barheru" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6691112)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barheru" >Barheru</a></span><br /> A big thanks to: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6104981&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="OCuin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6104981)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" >OCuin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sonderance" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6091992&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609605612" alt="Sonderance" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6091992)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sonderance" >Sonderance</a></span> for help with both!</p> 
