					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13966614</guid>
				<title>Georgian Gothic</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13966614/georgian-gothic</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 01 Jan 2021 09:58:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>HarryBlank</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6479803</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Yes, I posted this on the same day as the previous tale. I wasn't gonna just post an introduction all by itself, I'm not that specific variety of insane!</p> <p>This tale ties in to the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/hecatoncheires-cycle-hub">Hecatoncheires Cycle</a>! Only click that link if you want to read cool interconnected stories about MTF thaumaturges fighting aliens and cults and eldritch monstrosities across space and time. In other words, <em>everybody click that link.</em></p> <p>Thanks as always to my critters:</p> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609498858" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span> for valuable crit in the dead of night on an unlikely day;</p> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609498858" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span> for his unending font of constructive criticism, and the use of his Site;</p> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609498858" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" >minmin</a></span> for one of the first crits of the New Year! Including several excellent points about dramatic pacing and writing for location.</p> <p>Pics are mine, CC 3.0.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
